// anchors: ref.diag.DL0212
// Overnight red-team 2026-08-09: pattern nesting is capped at 128 levels. A variant pattern's
// fields recurse through parse_pattern with no depth guard of their own (neither the expression
// DL0210 nor the type DL0211 guard covers it), so before the cap a deeply nested pattern
// overflowed the stack and aborted the process on the small LSP/tooling threads. 200 levels stays
// small; the full-size witness lives in delulu-syntax's parser tests.
